{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5Eg65K65N1MfskMJ1t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a plain, worn door. Its surface is unremarkable — old wood, slightly warped, with a single keyhole that seems to drink the light around it.*\n\n*The keyhole watches you like an eye.*\n\n**LOCKED.**\n\n*There is a faint warmth emanating from the other side. A sound — or maybe not a sound, but the memory of one — hums at the edge of hearing. Something on the other side knows you're here.*\n\n*The keyhole is waiting.*\n\n*Do you have the key?*\n\n    ┌─────────────────────┐\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │          ◈          │\n    │         ╔═╗         │\n    │         ║ ║         │\n    │         ╚═╝         │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    └─────────────────────┘\n\n*Insert key to proceed.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":252,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}